co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/c9d7/live/595a7a00-70e8-11ef-bb5b-c361f7cd4381.jpg.webp","line":72,"embedded":true},{"title":"Getty Images Newspaper article about Congo's paintings. The headline is \"Art World goes wild for chimpanzee's paintings as Warhol work flops\".  There is a photo of both a chimp painting and the artist Andy Warhol and a colour picture of the chimps splashes of paint","target":"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/9c5e/live/629a7cf0-70e8-11ef-bb5b-c361f7cd4381.jpg.webp","line":90,"embedded":true},{"title":"Getty Images Desmond Morris and Congo the chimp (as a baby)","target":"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/93ca/live/b12c9fb0-70e8-11ef-bb5b-c361f7cd4381.jpg.webp","line":116,"embedded":true},{"title":"Getty Images Desmond Morris is looking at a toucan through the wire of a cage.  The toucan is looking at Morris.","target":"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/a1a0/live/b9dfa4e0-70e8-11ef-bb5b-c361f7cd4381.jpg.webp","line":132,"embedded":true},{"title":"Getty Images Desmond Morris painting. It is a surrealist landscape of half moons on pointed legs and a checked floor.","target":"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/187b/live/c0e85570-70e8-11ef-bb5b-c361f7cd4381.jpg.webp","line":148,"embedded":true},{"title":"Desmond Morris at home. This looks like a busy sitting room with Morris sitting on a red couch surrounded by books and his art works.","target":"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/7f9a/live/d4699eb0-70e8-11ef-bb5b-c361f7cd4381.jpg.webp","line":174,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Zoologist and author Desmond Morris dies aged 98","source":"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c51y797v200o","author":["[[Sam Woodhouse]]"],"published":"2026-04-20","created":"2026-04-26","description":"Morris, who was also a surrealist painter and broadcaster, was best known for his 1967 book The Naked Ape.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:resrc/clippings/Zoologis